            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Los datos guardados cambiaron. Actualiza y revisa una acción nueva; un reintento existente conserva sus datos y revisión originales."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These are household-entered records, not retailer prices, bank balances or verified savings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "These are household-entered records, not retailer prices, bank balances or verified savings."
